---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Tabs from "../components/Tabs.astro";
import CtaLink from "../components/CtaLink.astro";
import { bundle, foundingOffer, terms } from "../site";
---

<Base title="Both: site and numbers" description="A website and a data checkup from one person, for one price.">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-10 sm:px-6"><Tabs /></div>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 pt-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="max-w-5xl text-[clamp(2.75rem,7vw,6rem)]">
      The site brings them in. <span class="bg-accent-3 px-2 [box-decoration-break:clone]">The numbers say what they're worth.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-8 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed">
      Most owners hire a web person, then later wonder whether the site did anything. When the same person builds the site
      and reads the numbers, you get a straight answer: how many people booked, what they spent, and what to change next.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="sticker grid gap-8 bg-accent-3 p-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:items-center md:p-12">
      <div>
        <p class="font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase">Combo No. 1</p>
        <p class="mt-3 font-display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3.75rem)] leading-none font-black uppercase [font-stretch:125%]">
          {bundle.name}
        </p>
        <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed">
          A Starter Site (up to 5 pages, booking or ordering, Google profile cleanup, first month of care free), plus a Data
          Checkup a few weeks after launch, once there's something to measure.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="sticker rotate-3 justify-self-start bg-card px-8 py-6 text-center md:justify-self-end">
        <p class="font-display text-6xl font-black [font-stretch:125%]">{bundle.price}</p>
        <p class="mt-1 font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase">You save {bundle.saves}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto mt-16 grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-start">
    <div class="sticker -rotate-1 bg-accent p-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase">Founding clients</p>
      <p class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl leading-none font-black uppercase [font-stretch:125%]">15% off</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed">{foundingOffer}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="font-mono">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase">The fine print</p>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
        {terms.map((t) => <li class="border-b-2 border-dashed border-hairline pb-3">{t}</li>)}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6">
    <CtaLink href="/contact/?for=both">Book a call</CtaLink>
  </section>
</Base>
